\begin{definition}
\label{def:3.12}
Let $a,b\in\mathbb{R}$ with $a\le b$. A \emph{polynomial on $[a,b]$} is a function $f:[a,b]\to\mathbb{R}$ for which there exist an integer $n\ge 0$ and real numbers $c_0,\ldots,c_n\in\mathbb{R}$ such that
